 "title": "Adam Gray",
 "intro": "Adam Gray (Democratic Party) is a member of the U.S. House, representing California's 13th Congressional District. He assumed office on January 3, 2025. His current term ends on January 3, 2027.\nGray (Democratic Party) is running for re-election to the U.S. House to represent California's 13th Congressional District. He is on the ballot in the general election on November 3, 2026. He advanced from the primary on June 2, 2026.",
